==Battleground==
*6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 9.67~10 seconds<sup>290f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.67 seconds<sup>410f</sup>, delay 9.67~10 seconds<sup>290f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 14.33 seconds<sup>430f</sup>, delay 9.67~10 seconds<sup>290f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 15.33 seconds<sup>460f</sup>, delay 9.67~10 seconds<sup>290f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 9.67~10 seconds<sup>290f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns after 18.33 seconds<sup>550f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is essentially [[Slimy Stallions]] except easier as the other Sluggies are not present. Bring [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] and you should have an easy win.

